cle at 96% 92%, rgba(255,255,255,.08) 0 74px, transparent 75px)\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ra-shine\"></span><img src=\"img/p/canon-700d.webp\" alt=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; right: 64px; bottom: -18px; width: 34%; z-index: 1; filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.30))\"><div style=\"position: absolute; right: 14px; top: 22px; z-index: 1; transform: rotate(-7deg); background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.18)\"><b style=\"display: block; font-size: 26px; line-height: 28px; color: #077A70\">+{{freeDays}}</b><span style=\"font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; color: #4A5468\">HARI GRATIS</span></div><div style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2\"><div style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #CFF5EF\">Promo</div><b style=\"display: block; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 25px; letter-spacing: -.01em; max-width: 58%; color: #FFFFFF\">{{freeText}}</b></div><span style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2; align-self: flex-start; max-width: 64%; background: #FFFFFF; color: #1F2B4D; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 16px; border-radius: 14px; padding: 8px 12px\">{{freeSub}}</span></a></sc-if>\n      <a href=\"Akun.dc.html\" style=\"flex: 0 0 86%; max-width: 360px; height: 178px; border-radius: 22px; isolation: isolate; -webkit-mask-image: -webkit-radial-gradient(white, black); transform: translateZ(0); text-decoration: none; padding: 18px; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; scroll-snap-align: start; box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(31,43,77,.18); background: radial-gradient(90% 120% at 100% 0%, #FFD976 0%, #F2C14E 45%, #E79A2B 100%)\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(circle at 10% 18%, rgba(255,255,255,.10) 0 46px, transparent 47px), radial-gradient(circle at 96% 92%, rgba(255,255,255,.08) 0 74px, transparent 75px)\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ra-shine\"></span><div style=\"position: absolute; right: -8px; top: 30px; z-index: 1; transform: rotate(-9deg); width: 128px; height: 82px; border-radius: 14px; background: linear-gradient(140deg, #2A3A66, #1F2B4D); box-shadow: 0 14px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.22); padding: 10px 12px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .1em; color: #09BEAF\">MEMBER</span><b style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 24px; color: #FFFFFF\">10%</b><span style=\"height: 5px; width: 60%; border-radius: 3px; background: #F7B955\"></span></div><div style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2\"><div style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5C3A00\">Member Rentalaja</div><b style=\"display: block; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 25px; letter-spacing: -.01em; max-width: 62%; color: #1F2B4D\">{{memTitle}}</b></div><span style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2; align-self: flex-start; max-width: 64%; background: #1F2B4D; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 16px; border-radius: 14px; padding: 8px 12px\">{{memSub}}</span></a>\n      <sc-if value=\"{{antarOn}}\"><a href=\"Cari.dc.html\" style=\"flex: 0 0 86%; max-width: 360px; height: 178px; border-radius: 22px; isolation: isolate; -webkit-mask-image: -webkit-radial-gradient(white, black); transform: translateZ(0); text-decoration: none; padding: 18px; box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; scroll-snap-align: start; box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(31,43,77,.18); background: radial-gradient(90% 120% at 100% 100%, #3A4F86 0%, #1F2B4D 70%)\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(